            "review_text": "A L\nStratford-upon-Avon, United Kingdom510 contributions\n0\nAuthentic food\nJan 2025 • Couples\nBit of a way to get to this restaurant and if not for the Illuminated sign maybe impossible to find but found nevertheless. Not really a confidence boosting entrance but we have it a go. It’s not a first date restaurant, with pretty basic environment but we were there for the food and we were not disappointed ! Service was good and the food excellent. Portions are a bit on the small side but more than enough when we were ordering. Great vegetarian range, did not try the meat options. \n\nBe aware there are stairs up to the restaurant, which seems to be on the first floor. \n\nWe will try this place again.\nRead more\nWritten January 29, 2025\nHAVELI RESTAURANT - INDIAN CUISINE\nThank you so much for choosing us 💘😻\nWritten August 2, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
