            "review_text": "Old guy travels\nHouston, Texas303 contributions\n0\nGreat food in this unsuspecting place\nMay 2024 • Solo\nA hole in the wall restaurant in the back of a motor bike parking shop and up to the 1st floor. The place is small with just 2 rows of tables. The staff were friendly and the food delicious. Paratha, vindaloo chicken curry, rice and Masala tea. I can't find fault anywhere. Give it a try\nInsider tip:\ntourist rates for food. I paid $12 for lunch.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 10, 2024\nHAVELI RESTAURANT - INDIAN CUISINE\nThank you so much for choosing us. 💘😻\nWritten August 2, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
